{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_title", "source_sha256": "3bd11f4d137191eb3ef6a9300923f686a9b1167298c333be802be244262abb02", "ja": "どうか、届きますように", "zh": "但愿能够传达", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_synopsis", "source_sha256": "24af759d9bff5c908bc986a7def2df9da165530cb476abb5265a4ac5620c748d", "ja": "プロデューサーが担当を外れると勘違いした\n紬は、新曲公演で成長した姿を見せようと周\nりが心配するほどレッスンに打ちこむ。無事\nに誤解が解けた後、紬はあらためてファンの\nために、と凛として公演に臨む。", "zh": "䌷误以为制作人将不再培育自己，为了\n展现出自己成长后的模样而一味埋头苦练，\n让身边的人都十分担心。顺利解开误会后，\n䌷重新下定决心要为粉丝们努力，\n凛然地踏上了公演舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b65a0d057158d2b33c28940b8fbaf846ce0d50e746286822e44abe62f329295d", "ja": "（紬と一緒に出演するメンバーも決まり、新曲公演の\nレッスンが始まっている……様子を見に行ってみるか）", "zh": "（要和䌷一起表演的成员已经确定，现在正在进行\n新歌公演的训练课程……去看看她们的状况吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b170e2dcc9ac815e3b121fb16cdfbe1c647f89f81d7518e54b001f05dc582be2", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……通して踊れました……。\nこの感覚、忘れないうちに……。", "zh": "呼、呼……跳完整首歌了……\n得在还没忘记这个感觉之前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "5f8f0db56cf04612fc434d79c5c901521551bd4945641f6441e0d13a0b9783e8", "ja": "すごかったわね！　今のダンス、\nとっても息が合っていたんじゃないかしら？", "zh": "跳得真棒！\n刚才的舞蹈配合得非常好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "dd8f0271f7cf1a192f2083645a102cd2e227660317ecfb081fc40d21a5177c6b", "ja": "そうですね、スローな動きもずれていなくて。\nいい感じだと思います！", "zh": "就是说呀，慢动作的地方也没有乱掉，\n感觉很不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1004_p", "source_sha256": "02160bd7c755964e99ed9ae54eb46a9aed65b532aac962320611f6b605f75fff", "ja": "まだ日も経ってないのに……みんな、すごいな。\nどうしたんだ？", "zh": "才短短几天而已……真厉害啊。\n大家是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "09431d88dab944fc43b2413f53c3617375541b19f93d96d33763841c961ff346", "ja": "ムギのおかげかもな。\n真ん中で動きがブレないから、合わせやすいんだよ。", "zh": "或许是多亏了䌷呢。\n站在正中央的她舞步完全没出错，让人很好配合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "1f931e72b4ced0af7ee55f1d482d3c5b76e05505a6413c22eb80d305f7dd24a7", "ja": "指の先までしっかり、意識が通っているようです。\n気合いが入っていますね、紬。", "zh": "感觉连指尖的动作都做得很仔细。\n䌷真是干劲十足呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f55370c716578c9ecd7a8465bd87f5956d00491622189f5805cdac2d46d41058", "ja": "はい……。ですが、まだまだです。\nここからもっと、完成度を高めなくては……。", "zh": "是的……但是还远远不够。\n必须继续提升舞蹈的完成度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1008_p", "source_sha256": "cd921f12d33f0ff8d2c69c8e01b00c57d6825d792e8b2ddf191bb2c256410b2d", "ja": "おお、熱心だな。でも、そんなに焦ることないよ。\nまだ時間もあるし、じっくり完成度を高めて……。", "zh": "喔喔，真有热忱啊。不过，不需要那么着急。\n时间还很充裕，只要一步步提升完成度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5ecee6615d6623ae5e4e8ba069e3f023c53ab5f4315a22c9bfb1112eb3dcd02a", "ja": "そんな悠長なことは言っていられませんっ。\n今度の公演は私にとって、とても……大切な公演です！", "zh": "没有时间再悠哉下去了。\n这次的公演对我来说，是非常……非常重要的公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "064025fc30f3174510afece24bab1d512c44bccb41c48ccd433f0688dde4f803", "ja": "それともまさか、あなたにとっては……\nち、ち、違う、とでも？", "zh": "还是说，对你而言……\n并、并、并不是这样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1011_p", "source_sha256": "56c5dfe5f156a85daa1fb97b1bd6c3b8020d4cb78b7bbff24d24421e84d60e4b", "ja": "いや、そんなことないけど……。", "zh": "不，没有那回事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f1d9b2e1091fdd617dcc078e8df88f9743502c10c244cb2b27b7bb08df184ef8", "ja": "そ、それなら……いいのです。それなら……。", "zh": "那、那就好，那就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1fbb6c8a568c7af62b865b8ee3b01c8e80b8ea70bbdfe111170c189946299e6e", "ja": "（紬……？）", "zh": "（紬……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "0a38810361c3ccd8cd041f625b1db9076ab8b3a66c7de9cdc834acba0a598129", "ja": "紬ちゃん、大切な公演だからこそ、\n最初から無理しない方がいいと思うの。", "zh": "小䌷，我认为正因为是重要的公演，\n才更不该在一开始就这么逞强。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "1062c394c92991e1da42a6ee41d285a7a68482ea050b67cf3314c0a695848e40", "ja": "そうだよ。最初から最後まで頑張り続けるためにも、\nちゃんと自分の身体と相談しないと。", "zh": "就是说呀，为了持续努力到最后，\n必须好好审视自己的身体状况才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "746f002d1746dc11317167ff94ba3268da37fde80ccb022bf66854f7ebcb8e6c", "ja": "身体と相談……。そ、そうですね。\nお二人とも、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "审视自己的身体状况……\n说、说得也是，谢谢你们两位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2a834e1ed3118fef328797b4da31fb08640ee2c9fd7b1dab9e1653a7043190b8", "ja": "では、休憩にしましょう。\n私、飲み物を取ってくるので……失礼いたします。", "zh": "那么，我们就休息一下吧。\n我去拿饮料……先失陪了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "1edcd926575216ff9fa6e164e53f0b00e5bb48fb74bf39a31d28f5c1fe1c2e7d", "ja": "……{$P$}。\nやはり、紬は少しばかり……。", "zh": "……{$P$}。\n䌷果然有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a5354e2105b9ce3a2c66c41ca93b159480b2d66083ce1f535adfa9d6f1e4fe1a", "ja": "そうだな。\n何か、気負いすぎているというか……。", "zh": "是啊。\n她好像有点太逞强了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "8ea8df07ee14ff14419fc2eeb842e6fb311c11e8f034bbf379bf37839ef8f107", "ja": "ダンスだけじゃない。こないだ新曲の練習に\nつきあったんだけど……余裕がないんだよな。", "zh": "不只舞蹈，上次和䌷一起练新歌的时候……\n她看起来非常急躁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1021_052kao", "source_sha256": "ef9b31451a5b2ef541e999f88d1ebccfd3b77ccdb0ea10cc9f4f19e213814983", "ja": "詞とも旋律とも、真剣に向き合って……。心から\n理解しようとしているのが、伝わってくるんです。", "zh": "小䌷对歌词和旋律都十分认真地看待……\n我可以感受到她是真心想去理解这首歌的意境。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1022_052kao", "source_sha256": "426300f388dca23b1767564574e21e1aa53c3ef55c2ab963f84c96abc0019654", "ja": "それ自体は、いいことだと思います。\nただ……入り込み過ぎているように思えて。", "zh": "我认为这件事本身是非常好的。\n但……总觉得她有些太过投入了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1023_027say", "source_sha256": "5b181950fde33cbf57a92391d8290b4d61c3ccf30a71fbe5b71b004d4862ef5c", "ja": "新曲のお披露目公演だから、\nはりきるのはわかるんですけど……。", "zh": "毕竟这次是新歌的首次亮相公演，\n我可以理解她想卯足全力去做的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1024_008tak", "source_sha256": "e4261c6a52408860aeb43bad83f39b0f9a958578333f59865886f87bba14664d", "ja": "少しばかり、張りつめすぎているようです。\n今にも切れてしまいそうな糸のように……。", "zh": "但她好像有点太紧绷了。\n就像是一根随时可能断裂的琴弦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1025_p", "source_sha256": "c551d624ced1476ccecb90d1fe7e0ef0e700b4a7ee772d2c8326ae99561c1922", "ja": "張りつめた糸、か……。", "zh": "绷紧的琴弦吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1026_p", "source_sha256": "5b191fa3011466e5b330fb6e3e3eafef12040fcda8546ca0d5a72acb96b87bc3", "ja": "みんな、ありがとう。\nちょっと紬と話してくるよ。", "zh": "谢谢你们。\n我去和䌷谈一谈吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1027_052kao", "source_sha256": "0545f48faddb51b86072086087e060f7565f6bf95ea72b22749ad0be72f9440c", "ja": "お願いします……。あ、そうだわ！\nお話をするなら、ちょうどいいところが！", "zh": "麻烦你了……啊，对了！\n要谈话的话，有个非常合适的地点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1028_null", "source_sha256": "b51dfd95602ddeba2076b904866bddd2d33de5044a97d39d914d7a5836a1edaa", "ja": "そして…………", "zh": "然后…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1029_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0907e9f7ba27208483131789c33c463c9797a8ea373b78e5996417b30deca270", "ja": "いきなり人を連れ出したかと思えば……。\nこのお店のこと、ご存じだったのですか？", "zh": "还想说为什么突然把我带出来……\n原来你知道这间店吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1030_p", "source_sha256": "cc911c15748c899858c28fd6d24d2160f4f84d064543d9ae8be4f30f5b01547f", "ja": "歌織さんに聞いたんだよ。紬のオススメの店だって。\nせっかくだから、出張前に食べておこうと思って。", "zh": "我听歌织小姐说，这里是䌷推荐的甜点店。\n机会难得，我想说在出差前来尝尝看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1031_051tmg", "source_sha256": "47e33a393de608c4ea38e166dad4e81008492f2007b1938edbe910e5ec67f831", "ja": "そ……そうですか。\n出張の、前に……。", "zh": "这……这样啊。\n出差前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "99650d15a4f25f1697c5bbd97a3ac7aa56d89fc791dd4b1afe69363b7199203b", "ja": "ん、ん。それで、お話というのは？\nまだレッスンもありますから、手短にお願いします。", "zh": "嗯、嗯。所以，你要跟我谈什么？\n我还有训练课程，麻烦你长话短说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1033_p", "source_sha256": "55f2a930b750971fc0a56779032510c3b8bbfc2164ce476903f1cf65507af5a4", "ja": "そのことなんだけど……。\n紬、レッスンはしばらく休みにしよう。", "zh": "关于这件事……\n䌷，你暂时别参与训练课程了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1034_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cf784dc8488275797d57732539b88ede2514867c53e9f09c9da31fe5111a0ae5", "ja": "は？", "zh": "啥？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1035_p", "source_sha256": "c469775d961d73a72af3efe50d01f4b5d54c02a4af8e87af4489c596591501c0", "ja": "いや、レッスンだけじゃなくて仕事も。\nしばらく活動はお休みにしよう。", "zh": "不，不只是训练，工作也是。\n暂时停止所有活动吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1036_051tmg", "source_sha256": "521086dfb69a9beeafcabf58f88ee9aeea1f402c5222ff05584352927cd8e0c7", "ja": "あんた……なにいうとるん？\n休みって、公演は？　まさか……！？", "zh": "你……在说啥？\n说要停止活动，那公演怎么办？该不会……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1037_p", "source_sha256": "f4ef1ecb898320312adf0029d64fdd43d41c0ca1cafd348bb13b4b2f3675e4b7", "ja": "いや、公演は予定通り行ってもらうつもりだ。\nだけど今の紬は、休んだ方がいいと思う。", "zh": "不，公演会照原定计划举办。\n但是，现在的你还是好好休息比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1038_051tmg", "source_sha256": "beac47897410973e5804f290026f2fbac9c8776fa5aeebee577089acfa9d0f77", "ja": "今の……私……。", "zh": "现在的……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1039_p", "source_sha256": "6166f0e0c2ea91a5d6eebd04cee83cfc268280c5fae3310bdbe1648ee0e4f73c", "ja": "真面目なのは紬のいいところだけど、\n今の紬は、ちょっと……必死すぎるみたいだから。", "zh": "认真是䌷的优点，\n但现在的你……似乎有些太过拼命了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1040_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d805b975f93cebce28e6a9e0e4072cd594702dc34ce106f2f6064b1227e15ca7", "ja": "い、いい公演にしようと最善を尽くすのは、\nそんなにいけないことなのですか？", "zh": "为、为了完成最棒的公演而全力以赴，\n是这么不可取的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1041_p", "source_sha256": "90f19712e0ca0f7385c7067d7e3dfc9296c9688407053e7920a54df3355db5ad", "ja": "そうだな。周りに心配かけるほど頑張るのは、\n間違いなく、よくないと思う。", "zh": "这个嘛，如果努力到让周围的人都替你担心，\n我想绝对不是一件好事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1042_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cc2feba67552097a0ea307b01be15fad680c766f1d34442637a1b599709a6cad", "ja": "……はっきり、仰るのですね。\n私も、その通りだとは思いますけれど。", "zh": "……你说得很直接呢。\n不过，其实我也有自觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1043_051tmg", "source_sha256": "681b0cd3842254f39ab6011fb7662656586c60ec04f6e103bafa3c105b6c1a1d", "ja": "でも……私は……。", "zh": "但是……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1044_p", "source_sha256": "c9c21ee373da388845366aba1632c1a2b58f7b13c339ae7f0c9e70140a5bbcd0", "ja": "……何かあるなら、聞かせてくれないか。\nこれでも一応、紬のプロデューサーなんだ。", "zh": "……如果有什么心事，能不能说给我听呢？\n我再怎么说也是䌷的制作人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1045_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6de6a6eb1a1afcd7d20a10e11dee0bad018527624690279e5af7952738c815c6", "ja": "だから……です。", "zh": "就因为是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1046_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1047_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0298a8ed2494ee53909497b06d4ed98aff02ef69db5d92eadc1212a61d927f4d", "ja": "あなたが、私の……\nプロデューサーだから……。", "zh": "就因为你是……\n我的制作人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1048_p", "source_sha256": "53979d66d1838de7c9e714a9977e47eb44aef6112229b7d8d4afe436046e0484", "ja": "俺が紬のプロデューサー……だから？", "zh": "因为我是……䌷的制作人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1049_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ea60d9635c4bbfe611e36fe8502ef05eb7c079b2936118d329ab5f2fa1fecd1b", "ja": "…………。公演が決まってから、よく思い出します。\nあの日……あなたと出会った日のこと。", "zh": "…………自从公演行程敲定后，\n我就经常回想起那一天……和你相遇的日子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1050_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e06cbbb1480c0c133db69a7189392ec08ae4103f2e38fd9d379241270896e7f5", "ja": "私がアイドルだなんて、たわいもない夢だと思って\nいました。誰もが幼いころに抱く、錯覚のような……。", "zh": "我本来以为，成为偶像只是个天真的梦想。\n就像许多人幼年时期都曾怀抱过的、仿佛错觉般的梦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1051_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9b22868f400e4be8f74dbf34e24bc370af1602b0c95989b0b42d017f59dcf7f3", "ja": "そんな、色あせて消えかかっていた私の夢を、あなたは\n鮮やかに染め直して、心の中に置いていって。", "zh": "是你将我那已褪色、几乎消逝的梦想重新染上色彩，\n并再次放回我心中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1052_051tmg", "source_sha256": "56668b357ef2c17edff5fe8d353b5a9be457245bb2fa6ceb28feb70da83cf3b0", "ja": "それから、本当に……\n私の夢を、かなえてしまいました。", "zh": "在那之后，我的梦想……\n真的实现了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1053_p", "source_sha256": "f7b59e7a7f71362405cfe63b9119681d949d9a16f7a71cf1b6e626a1413a5e5e", "ja": "紬……。", "zh": "䌷……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1054_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0fb60e790494e3f1aa3c5e0f70e480856fdf13deda5b392e60e1d65b7180a855", "ja": "も、もちろん、アイドルはステージで輝かなくては\n話になりません。私は本当に……まだまだです。", "zh": "当、当然，偶像要是无法在舞台上绽放光彩就没意义了。\n我的实力……还远远不足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1055_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3cfef317e8795dc6f2e2d26577f4f29ed984959c72e48587e13e9a354a6e8d1d", "ja": "だ、だからこそ、私は……できる限りの最高の\nステージをお見せしたいのです。", "zh": "正、正因如此，\n我……想尽全力让你看到我最棒的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1056_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f3b8820fa35e59d692fa708f4ce4890b0d05e69dd257b445c516bec26fa51e0f", "ja": "あなたにとって、さ、さ……、\n最後のプロデュースになる、次の公演で！", "zh": "就在对你来说，最、最……\n最后一次担任制作人的下次公演中！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_1057", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_2000_p", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_2001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3dde50219c0758845ed0a581218dec1bbe3c4787b3855d1cc33e227ecfdeadab", "ja": "あなたと出会ってからの私が、どうなったのか……。\nどんなアイドルに成長したのか。", "zh": "和你相遇之后的我，究竟有哪些改变……\n究竟成为了什么样的偶像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_2002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "624268d74e2ce386039435e65eb2954820e628bf6c7471d26689e18f58ed2a12", "ja": "あなたのプロデュースの成果を、私がお見せします。\n今の、最高の私で。ですから……。", "zh": "我会拿出自己现在最棒的表现，\n向你展现你培育的成果，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_2003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c8a42cc06e97c23fd9fd99475e727cde8690baac898f97e35923b4b6bdccc031", "ja": "どうか、最後まで……、見届けてください。あなたが\nどれだけ遠くに行ってしまったとしても、私は……！", "zh": "还请你……好好看到最后。\n无论你要到多遥远的地方去，我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_2004_p", "source_sha256": "b07dcf5d2260d8741ab557a4e7e558bf97176b3da98aeceaf1972e98622bf5e9", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと待ってくれ！　遠くにって……、\nどういうことだ？", "zh": "等、等一下！你说到很遥远的地方去……\n是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_2005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b1e4a6c0e3740d052090d442ccf0c71b011068ff8eb6cd39682651f78234162f", "ja": "ど、どうって！\nですから、海外に行ってしまうのでしょう？", "zh": "还、还问我什么意思！\n你不是要去国外吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_2006_p", "source_sha256": "579af3b1740340fa778771b92ed3e42f34651c8826221439c9b758ad964b3542", "ja": "あ、ああ。今度の仕事のロケ地の視察とかで……。\nまあ、3日ほどで帰ってくる出張だけど。", "zh": "啊，是啊，我要去视察下次工作的外景地……\n虽然出差时间只有三天就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_2007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2f6015246c7896136ef1b82bc83f329d3175e7100fc704a499ca5bd5754ecc59", "ja": "えっ。", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_2008_p", "source_sha256": "86970dd2a8ede70ef512e2ef207001f5348c097817945715c1f860bacf3b7cf2", "ja": "あと海外っていっても、太平洋の島だから、\nそんなに遠くないんだ。だから……", "zh": "还有说是出国，其实也只是到太平洋上的岛屿去而已。\n没有很远，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_2010_p", "source_sha256": "961d2425a7820aad7e57f42ced374071778a2573e224d73417d6cc6f7ac44b45", "ja": "その……、新曲公演の後に一瞬いなくなるけど……\n帰ってきたら、また一緒に頑張りたいんだけど……", "zh": "那个……我虽然会在新歌公演结束后离开几天……\n但回来后还是希望能继续跟你一起努力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_2011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5e09b44ee55b1b2be2e352f9871f4b31918f96db6d8e30f331bbf043411614e4", "ja": "………………っ！！！", "zh": "………………！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_2012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4221c4b26d2c867a1ff5d9cedf810a4b55704847101f6fb2f625efe6b9224037", "ja": "か、帰ります！！", "zh": "我、我要走了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_2013_p", "source_sha256": "063d1c92e3650448403e57a21a3d25dcde2c077e743e63d9780c660ae14d2377", "ja": "うわあっ、待ってくれ！　とりあえずごめん！\n勘違いさせちゃったみたいで悪かった！　この通り！", "zh": "呜哇，等等！总之对不起！\n抱歉让你产生误会了！请接受我的道歉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_2014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "de9c56ef5ed82315493e030bd3577c3b64e279ba12f9251908644824100e8ec2", "ja": "知りませんっ！\nこ、こんなん……がんこ恥ずかしいげん……。", "zh": "才不要！\n……人、人家竟然会错意了……好丢人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
