{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_046_2023_027say", "source_sha256": "a6b5229ead332770a5dd49a1b81c27435bcc066ad1686be9a82f87b0bb6eb5b0", "ja": "ふふっ、でも、誤解が解けてよかったです。\nそれに……ケガの功名っていうか。", "zh": "呵呵，不过，能解开误会真是太好了。\n而且……该说是因祸得福吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
